{
  "id": "798",
  "title": "Are Ghosts Real?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-03-04",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming comes across something scary in the elevator. Could it be a ghost?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/798/ef36af251368aac73a4704a56b633ee5bd4e9dde.mp3?1582298692",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "有鬼？\n\n    一天，小明看了一部鬼片后，出门坐电梯。到了3楼，门开了，一个老爷爷，拖着一根绳子，慢慢地走了进来。\n    小明不知道为什么他要拖着一根绳子，小明想：是不是真的有鬼啊？\n    小明很害怕。突然，他听到老爷爷说了一句：“呀！我的狗呢？”",
    "traditional": "有鬼？\n\n    一天，小明看了一部鬼片後，出門坐電梯。到了3樓，門開了，一個老爺爺，拖著一根繩子，慢慢地走了進來。\n    小明不知道為什麼他要拖著一根繩子，小明想：是不是真的有鬼啊？\n    小明很害怕。突然，他聽到老爺爺說了一句：“呀！我的狗呢？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are Ghosts Real?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小明看了一部鬼片后，出门坐电梯。",
      "traditional": "一天，小明看了一部鬼片後，出門坐電梯。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo míng kàn le yí bù guǐ piàn hòu chū mén zuò diàn tī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "到了3楼，门开了，一个老爷爷，拖着一根绳子，慢慢地走了进来。",
      "traditional": "到了3樓，門開了，一個老爺爺，拖著一根繩子，慢慢地走了進來。",
      "pinyin": "dào le 1 lóu mén kāi le yí ge lǎo yé ye tuō zhe yì gēn shéng zi màn man de zǒu le jìn lái",
      "english": "One day, after Little Ming finished watching a horror movie, he left the house and used the elevator."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "After reaching the third floor the door opened, and an old man, dragging a rope, slowly walked inside."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明不知道为什么他要拖着一根绳子，小明想：是不是真的有鬼啊？",
      "traditional": "小明不知道為什麼他要拖著一根繩子，小明想：是不是真的有鬼啊？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bù zhī dào wèi shén me tā yào tuō zhe yì gēn shéng zi xiǎo míng xiǎng shì bú shì zhēn de yǒu guǐ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming didn’t know why he was dragging a rope; Little Ming thought to himself, “Are ghosts actually real?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明很害怕。",
      "traditional": "小明很害怕。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hěn hài pà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "突然，他听到老爷爷说了一句：“呀！我的狗呢？”",
      "traditional": "突然，他聽到老爺爺說了一句：“呀！我的狗呢？”",
      "pinyin": "tū rán tā tīng dào lǎo yé ye shuō le yí jù ya wǒ de gǒu ne",
      "english": "Little Ming was very scared."
    }
  ],
